The paper studies MAX-r-SAT above the tight random-assignment lower bound.
Section 3, Theorem 1 converts bounded-width parity equations to exact r-CNF.
This module inverse-generates a uniquely solvable, coupled 3-XOR system, uses
that conversion to obtain an exact 3-CNF instance, and carries the assignment
through a random variable relabelling.  Generation never solves its output.
