NOTES = r"""
Paper definition. Section 2 defines an exact r-CNF formula as a multiset of
clauses, every clause containing exactly r distinct literals and no
complementary pair. MAX-r-SAT_tlb asks whether an assignment satisfies at
least ((2^r-1)m+k)/2^r clauses.  This module fixes r=3 and k=m, so the exact
threshold is m and a witness must satisfy every displayed clause.

Step-0 discrimination. The prior suggestion--sample random clauses conditioned
