worst-case NP-hardness but no hardness theorem for that planted distribution.
More importantly, Section 3, Theorem 1 gives an O(m)+2^{O(k^2)} FPT decision
algorithm, an O(k^2) kernel, and an efficient witness route using a 4r-wise
independent sample space or exhaustive search.  Section 4 makes r=2 still
